| Astra | 146/154 = 0.948 | 1.000 (139) | 146/146 = 1.000 | 552 | 19 | 11 |
| Opus | 102/111 = 0.919 | 0.990 (97) | 64/102 = 0.627 | 1,422 | 98 | 221 |
| Fable | 106/120 = 0.883 | 0.900 (110) | 66/106 = 0.623 | 1,795 | 336 | 188 |
