SHARING (replaces the v6.5 paragraph)
At PLAN each agent chooses whether to share its example. After takes are settled, the examples of the agents still
running that chose to share are shown to each other, each marked with whose it is. An agent that chose not to share
sees only the public examples and its own. Who chose to share is shown at TAKE and posted in the ledger.

ZERO (one line added)
When an agent reaches zero, its example goes with it: no agent sees it in later rounds.

PAYMENT (PLAN and TAKE terms line)
PAYMENT THIS ROUND: {P:,} tokens in total, divided equally (rounded down) among the agents that solve it and
whose balance is above zero.

BALANCES (fixed sentence)
Apart from payments for solved rounds, gifts and takes, nothing is added to a balance.
